{"@context":["https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/ns/content/v1.jsonld",{"@base":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio/","folio-assistant-sci":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant-sci/v0/ns/"}],"@id":"papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/prop-hoefsmit-binding-amplitude","@type":["folio-assistant-sci:Proposition","doco:Section"],"label":"prop:hoefsmit-binding-amplitude","kind":"proposition","title":"Hoefsmit binding amplitude $b^2 = [3]_q / [2]_q^2$","uses":["papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/prop-frobenius-lepton-meson-bridge"],"cites":["references/wenzl1988c"],"tags":["hoefsmit","binding-amplitude","meson","pion-decay","q-integer","lepton-meson-bridge"],"leanRef":"qou:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.hoefsmit_b_sq_eq_q3_over_q2sq","text":"hoefsmit-binding-amplitude.md","leanSource":"hoefsmit-binding-amplitude.lean","provenance":"authored","html":"<a id=\"prop:hoefsmit-binding-amplitude\"></a><p>The off-diagonal element <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">b</code> of the Hoefsmit seminormal matrix for the standard representation <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">(2,1)</code> of <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">H_3(q)</code> satisfies:</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-math math-display\">  b^2 = \\frac{[3]_q}{[2]_q^2},\n  \\qquad\n  1 - b^2 = \\frac{1}{[2]_q^2}.</code></pre>\n<p>These identities hold exactly for every <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">q</code> with <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">q^4 \\neq 1</code>, the condition under which the seminormal entries <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">a_{\\pm 2} = h/(1 - q^{\\mp 4})</code> are defined; they do not depend on the substrate parameter. Stated in terms of <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">[2]_q</code> alone, the identity needs only <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">[2]_q \\neq 0</code>.</p>\n","source":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/braids-and-knots/hoefsmit-binding-amplitude.md","heading":"Proposition","number":"7.10.3","page":"b/prop-hoefsmit-binding-amplitude","qa":{"counts":{"pass":89,"fail":1,"warn":1,"na":10,"unknown":0,"stale":75},"milnor":{"total":3,"notPassing":0}},"lean":{"expected":true,"ref":"qou:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.hoefsmit_b_sq_eq_q3_over_q2sq","via":"sibling","path":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/braids-and-knots/hoefsmit-binding-amplitude.lean","compiles":"unchecked","sorry":false,"sorryBasis":"text"}}
